{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"QUIZTON (Thesis Project)","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/bc3b9/quizton_banner.png","srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/9a130/quizton_banner.png 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/a3fa1/quizton_banner.png 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/bc3b9/quizton_banner.png 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/87926/quizton_banner.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/dae43/quizton_banner.avif 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/d7667/quizton_banner.avif 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/7ec1a/quizton_banner.avif 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/71a30/quizton_banner.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/5d873/quizton_banner.webp 175w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/26a00/quizton_banner.webp 350w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/f23f0/quizton_banner.webp 700w,\n/static/e529ab8c44629b151809ccf2681b27f4/2c2d0/quizton_banner.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Python","HTML","CSS","JavaScript","Firebase","Cloudinary","Render","spaCy"],"github":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/QUIZTON","external":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/QUIZTON","tag":"Private"},"html":"<p><strong>QUIZTON</strong> is an AI-powered web app developed as a thesis project for <a href=\"https://sjcdc.phinma.edu.ph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">St. Jude College Dasmariñas</a>. It helps educators save time and effort by automatically transforming PDF lecture materials into customized quizzes. The platform features intelligent PDF-to-question conversion using <strong>NLP</strong>, a centralized question bank, and flexible export options to streamline assessment creation and improve teaching efficiency.</p>\n<p>🔒 <em>Repository is private due to academic confidentiality and institutional usage agreements.</em></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Study Sprint AI","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/bc3b9/studysprint.png","srcSet":"/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/9a130/studysprint.png 175w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/a3fa1/studysprint.png 350w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/bc3b9/studysprint.png 700w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/87926/studysprint.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/dae43/studysprint.avif 175w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/d7667/studysprint.avif 350w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/7ec1a/studysprint.avif 700w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/71a30/studysprint.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/5d873/studysprint.webp 175w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/26a00/studysprint.webp 350w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/f23f0/studysprint.webp 700w,\n/static/01d84a9a6bce30b6f5da9d7e121a6a3e/2c2d0/studysprint.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Java","Android Studio","Pandas","Firebase","ML Kit"],"github":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/STUDYSPRINT-AI_MOBILE_APP","external":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/STUDYSPRINT-AI_MOBILE_APP","tag":"Featured"},"html":"<p><strong>Study Sprint AI</strong> is a smart Android flashcard app designed to help users <strong>memorize faster</strong> and <strong>study smarter</strong>. It leverages <strong>AI-powered adaptive learning algorithms</strong> and integrates tools like <strong>OCR</strong> and <strong>ML Kit</strong> for converting notes into flashcards. Users can track progress, study in Pomodoro cycles, and get performance feedback through clean analytics dashboards.</p>\n<p>As <strong>Lead Developer</strong>, engineered the full app lifecycle, from OCR integration to adaptive flashcard generation and Firebase-based syncing.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"ShapeShift: Gamified Fitness Challenge App","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/bc3b9/banner.png","srcSet":"/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/9a130/banner.png 175w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/a3fa1/banner.png 350w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/bc3b9/banner.png 700w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/87926/banner.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/dae43/banner.avif 175w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/d7667/banner.avif 350w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/7ec1a/banner.avif 700w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/71a30/banner.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/5d873/banner.webp 175w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/26a00/banner.webp 350w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/f23f0/banner.webp 700w,\n/static/4043e6a954dc24ebc6f444c9e23060b1/2c2d0/banner.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"tech":["Java","Android Studio","XML","Firebase"],"github":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/SHAPESHIFT_GYM_MOBILE_APP","external":"https://github.com/paufrancisco/SHAPESHIFT_GYM_MOBILE_APP","tag":"Featured"},"html":"<p>A mobile fitness application designed to gamify workouts and promote a healthy lifestyle. <strong>ShapeShift</strong> calculates a user's <strong>BMI</strong> and recommends personalized workout programs, allowing users to choose from challenge modes, track progress, and stay motivated through goal-driven features. Progress is synced with <strong>Firebase</strong>, and the app includes workout logs, timers, and visual trackers.</p>\n<p>As <strong>Lead Developer</strong>, handled full-cycle development including Android UI design, logic implementation, and Firebase backend integration.</p>"}}]}}}